  "item": [
    {
      "id": "35f453c8-4754-4d41-a567-4d055731841b",
      "name": "users",
      "description": {
        "content": "Users API Represents WHO created content on your platform. These are the end users that have uploaded content to your platform, meaning the people who are the creators or publishers of the content. For example, the account used for creating an image. A user can also be someone who likes, reacts, follows, administers, shares items and so on.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "2ef11d2b-54f6-494c-95ba-22467ae4da3d",
          "name": "Users API",
          "request": {
            "name": "Users API",
            "description": {
              "content": "Endpoint: https://api.alice.io/v3/users/upsert\n\nThe Users API enables you to send details about a user of your platform to the Alice T&S platform, which will analyze it, detect violations and return an array of one or more violations detected in the item. If the ID of this user already exists, then its details are updated.\n\nThe T&S platform analyzes the **name**, **description** and **nickname** fields of each item.\n\n**NOTE** - **name and nickname fields are limited to 1,024 characters. Description field is limited to 10,240 characters**.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v3",
                "users",
                "upsert"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
